Algorithm CompressionNumber(C):
  Input: Finite category C with objects Ob(C), morphisms Hom(X,Y), composition
  Output: kappa(C) and a witnessing separating family P

  for k = 0, 1, ..., |Ob(C)|:
    for each P subset of Ob(C) with |P| = k:
      if IsYonedaSeparating(C, P):
        return (k, P)

Algorithm IsYonedaSeparating(C, P):
  for each (X, Y) in Ob(C) x Ob(C):
    for each distinct pair f, g in Hom(X, Y):
      separated := false
      for each Q in P:
        for each h in Hom(Y, Q):
          if f;h != g;h:
            separated := true; break
      if not separated: return false
  return true

Time: O(2^n * p * n * m) where n=|Ob|, p=parallel pairs, m=max|Hom|
Space: O(n)

